# Migrations

We deploy with rolling restarts, so for a few minutes the previous release and the new one run
against the same database. Every migration must work with both releases:

- add columns as nullable or with a default; never add a NOT NULL column without one
- never rename or drop a column in the release that stops using it; drop it one release later
- backfills run as a separate job, never inside the migration
